{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB新聞主播譚詩雅（Zya）外表甜美深受網民喜愛，她自今年3月宣布離巢後，大批網民感嘆與不捨。</p><p>早前女星袁澧林公開透露曾遭性騷擾後，Zya近日亦勇敢於社交平台發聲，大爆自己初出茅廬時險遭「潛規則」的慘痛經歷。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.729856+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_hash":"2690f4cf72c075d2560edab2177beab0ae0603cec4a397eeef03e733146d0e5a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}